    <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#082f49] mb-4 border-b pb-2">Visa for Tanzania</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">Most tourists need a visa to enter Tanzania. You can obtain a visa through two methods:</p>

    <div class="info-box">
      <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#082f49] mb-2">1. Online Visa (e-Visa)</h4>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Visit the official website <strong>visa.immigration.go.tz</strong> to apply for your visa online. It is fast, easy, and highly recommended.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="info-box">
      <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#082f49] mb-2">2. Visa on Arrival</h4>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">You can obtain a visa upon arrival at the airport in Tanzania. However, please note that this process can take a long time due to queues.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#082f49] mt-10 mb-4 border-b pb-2">Visa Fees</h2>
