            <th>Visa Type</th>
            <th>Cost</th>
            <th>Duration</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Single Entry Visa</td>
            <td class="font-bold text-[#0c4a6e]">$50 USD</td>
            <td>90 Days</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Multiple Entry Visa</td>
            <td class="font-bold text-[#0c4a6e]">$100 USD</td>
            <td>90 Days</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Transit Visa</td>
            <td class="font-bold text-[#0c4a6e]">$30 USD</td>
            <td>7 Days</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>US Citizens Visa</td>
            <td class="font-bold text-[#0c4a6e]">$100 USD</td>
            <td>90 Days</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#082f49] mt-10 mb-4 border-b pb-2">Visa Exempt Countries</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-600">
      <li>Kenya</li>
      <li>Uganda</li>
      <li>Rwanda</li>
      <li>Burundi</li>
      <li>South Sudan</li>
      <li>Zambia</li>
      <li>Malawi</li>
      <li>Mozambique</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#082f49] mt-10 mb-4 border-b pb-2">Visa for Zanzibar</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Zanzibar is part of Tanzania — therefore, a Tanzanian visa is valid for Zanzibar as well. There is no separate visa required for Zanzibar.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#082f49] mt-10 mb-4 border-b pb-2">Required Documents</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-600">
      <li>Valid passport (6+ months validity)</li>
      <li>Passport-sized photograph</li>
      <li>Return flight ticket</li>
      <li>Hotel booking confirmation</li>
      <li>Proof of sufficient funds</li>
      <li>Completed application form</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#082f49] mt-10 mb-4 border-b pb-2">Visa Tips</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-600">
      <li>Apply for your visa early — at least 30 days before your trip.</li>
      <li>Ensure your passport is valid and not expiring soon.</li>
      <li>Keep a photocopy of your passport.</li>
      <li>Always check the official Tanzania Embassy website for updates.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="info-box mt-8 border-l-4 border-red-500 bg-red-50">
